**5.1 Voice Dictation Integration**

-   Microphone button (🎤) on every text field --- long press to record,
    release to transcribe

-   Uses device native speech-to-text (iOS: SFSpeechRecognizer, Android:
    SpeechRecognizer API)

-   Works offline for short phrases --- full transcription requires
    connectivity

-   Transcribed text appears in the field --- user can edit before
    submitting

-   \'Work performed\' field supports multi-sentence dictation --- most
    important use case

**5.2 Photo Auto-Tagging**

-   Photos taken within the daily report flow are automatically tagged
    with: project, date, report, GPS coordinates

-   Photos stored locally immediately --- uploaded in background when
    connectivity available

-   Up to 20 photos per daily report --- original resolution captured,
    thumbnails generated on upload

-   Photos from daily report automatically appear in project photo feed
    on web

