**8.2 Camera & Media Integration**

-   Photo capture: React Native Camera --- full resolution capture, EXIF
    data preserved (GPS, timestamp)

-   Batch capture mode: field workers stay in camera mode and capture
    multiple photos in sequence

-   Photo compression: images resized to 2048px max dimension, JPEG 85%
    quality before upload --- reduces bandwidth without meaningful
    quality loss at viewing size

-   Thumbnails: 200px thumbnails generated on server after upload ---
    used in lists and feeds

-   Video: not supported in v1.0 --- file size and bandwidth concerns.
    Planned for v2.0.

-   Document scanning: camera-based document capture for field notes or
    paper forms --- auto-cropping and perspective correction via ML Kit
    (future)

