**9.2 Security Requirements**

-   JWT tokens stored in React Native Keychain (iOS Keychain / Android
    Keystore) --- never in AsyncStorage which is unencrypted

-   Biometric authentication: Face ID / Touch ID option for app unlock
    --- token is unlocked from Keychain after biometric success

-   Certificate pinning: API calls validate against pinned certificate
    to prevent MITM attacks

-   Screenshot prevention: sensitive financial screens use FLAG_SECURE
    (Android) / UIScreen.isCaptured detection (iOS) to prevent
    screenshots --- configurable

-   Jailbreak/root detection: app logs a warning if device is jailbroken
    or rooted --- does not block use but flags in audit log

-   Auto-lock: app locks after 30 minutes of inactivity --- requires
    biometric or PIN to re-enter

